hint: This error likely indicates that `paper-source` depends on `pkg_resources`, but doesn't declare it as a build dependency. If `paper-source` is a first-party package, consider adding `pkg_resources` to its `build-system.requires`. Otherwise, either add it to your `pyproject.toml` under:

